					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-226460#post-4029171</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-226460/the-best-and-the-wisest-man-whom-i-have-ever-known#post-4029171</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 19 Oct 2018 16:23:59 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Oculism</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4441706</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>&quot;No&#8230; not just someone else. If he knew Clef, possibly the entire GOC knew how to kill Jack Bright. An entire worldwide organization with the backing of the goddamn United Nations, thousands of highly trained agents dedicated to finding and killing him.</p> <p>Suddenly he was very aware of just how vulnerable he was in the monorail car. This small, enclosed space, bound to the monorail tracks&#8230;. a perfect killing ground&quot;</p> <p>This has to be one of my favorite lines in writing ever. It captures the incessant amount of fear Bright felt at that exact moment as his brain slowly processed that his days were numbered and he was being hunted, and this time he didn't have a second chance.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
